OL,3,GNEWSAEvri delivery depot behind the    
OL,4,Ascenes on Black Friday                 
OL,6,FCourier firm Evri has insisted "trust  
OL,7,Fwill be earned" as it prepares to      
OL,8,Fdeliver millions of parcels over the   
OL,9,FChristmas period.                      
OL,11,FThe under-fire parcel delivery company 
OL,12,Fhas faced criticism in recent years    
OL,13,Ffrom customers, with concerns raised in
OL,14,FParliament about lost parcels.         
OL,16,FAs its operation ramps up for Black    
OL,17,FFriday and the pre-Christmas surge in  
OL,18,Fonline shopping, the BBC has been      
OL,19,Fbehind the scenes at its depot in      
OL,20,FSouthampton.                           
